content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Rental Manager",
      "description": "Oversees rental operations, inventory, and customer relationships"
    },
    {
      "name": "Monthly Inventory Record",
      "description": "Summary of equipment usage and availability trends"
    },
    {
      "name": "Monthly Revenue Report",
      "description": "Financial summary of rental income and payments",
      "attributes": [
        "Payment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "description": "Customer payment for equipment rental services"
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment",
      "description": "Physical items available for rental",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment Status",
        "Maintenance Log"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment Status",
      "description": "Current condition and availability of equipment"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Log",
      "description": "History of all maintenance and repairs performed"
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment Order",
      "description": "Purchase order for new equipment from distributor",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment Distributor",
      "description": "Supplier of new equipment for the rental business"
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment Reservation",
      "description": "Booking for specific equipment during a time period",
      "attributes": [
        "Rental Period",
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rental Period",
      "description": "Start and end dates for equipment usage"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rental Agreement",
      "description": "Legal contract outlining rental terms and conditions",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment Reservation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person or company renting equipment",
      "attributes": [
        "Customer Site Location"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Site Location",
      "description": "Where equipment will be delivered and used"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Feedback",
      "description": "Comments and ratings about rental experience"
    },
    {
      "name": "Accountant",
      "description": "Handles financial transactions and reporting"
    },
    {
      "name": "Invoice Reminder",
      "description": "Notification sent for overdue payments",
      "attributes": [
        "Invoice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Invoice",
      "description": "Bill sent to customer for rental charges"
    },
    {
      "name": "Malfunction Report",
      "description": "Documentation of equipment issues or damage"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Technician",
      "description": "Services and repairs rental equipment"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Inspection",
      "description": "Assessment of equipment condition after return",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment Delivery",
      "description": "Scheduled transport of equipment to customer site",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment",
        "Customer Site Location"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Driver",
      "description": "Transports equipment to and from customer locations"
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
